        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LAYER BARRIER + STATE MACHINE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kahn: in-degree-0 seeds a layer · whole queue = 1 layer&lt;br&gt;a layer is dispatched as a unit — Promise.allSettled&lt;br&gt;layer N+1 waits for layer N to settle&lt;br&gt;condition returns branchTaken &amp;#8594; engine marks edges&lt;br&gt;_markBranchSkipped walks the subtree · checked first&lt;br&gt;── VALID_TRANSITIONS state.js · bad pair throws ──&lt;br&gt;PENDING&amp;#8594;RUNNING · RUNNING&amp;#8594;WAIT_APPROVAL|COMPLETED|FAILED&lt;br&gt;WAIT_APPROVAL&amp;#8594;RUNNING|FAILED · COMPLETED/FAILED terminal" class="card.invariant" id="card_layers">
